<!-- account-password-changed — the platform's only detector of a SUCCESSFUL silent takeover.

     Every other control in the auth stack exists to PREVENT an illegitimate password write. This
     message exists for the case where one happened anyway — a phished code, a compromised inbox, an
     insider. If the real address receives it and it wasn't them, they can act. Without it, a
     successful takeover is completely silent.

     ⚠⚠ NO RESET LINK IN THIS EMAIL. EVER. ⚠⚠
     The instinct is to be helpful: "if this wasn't you, click here to reset". That link is itself a
     phishing primitive — it trains people to click password links in unsolicited mail, which is what
     every credential-phishing campaign depends on — and it puts a one-click account-recovery
     affordance into a message that, by hypothesis, may be arriving in an inbox an attacker already
     controls. Tell them to contact support. Nothing else. -->

<mjml lang="en" dir="ltr">
  <mj-head>
    <mj-include path="../generated/theme.mjml" />
    <mj-title>Your {{effyProductName}} password</mj-title>
    <mj-preview>If this wasn&rsquo;t you, contact support straight away.</mj-preview>
  </mj-head>

  <mj-body width="600px" background-color="#f5f5f5" css-class="e-bg-page">
    <mj-include path="../components/header.mjml" />

    <mj-section padding="0 32px 32px 32px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text mj-class="h1" css-class="e-ink e-h1">
          {{#if isFirstPassword}}A password was added to your account{{else}}Your password was changed{{/if}}
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text mj-class="muted" css-class="e-muted" padding="12px 0 0 0">
          {{#if isFirstPassword}}A password was just added to your {{effyProductName}} account. You can now sign in with either your password or an emailed code.{{else}}Your {{effyProductName}} password was just changed.{{/if}}
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text mj-class="muted" css-class="e-muted" padding="12px 0 0 0">
          For your security, this signed you out on every device.
        </mj-text>

        <!-- ⚠ Contact, not a link to reset. See the header. -->
        <mj-text mj-class="small" css-class="e-muted" padding="24px 0 0 0">
          If this wasn&rsquo;t you, contact {{effyProductName}} support straight away at {{effySupportEmail}}.
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-include path="../components/footer.mjml" />
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
